ok anywhere else. Shri Hita Harivansh Mahaprabhu descension of Shri Krishn's flute says, this supreme blissful Radha has put such a divine sweet and intoxicating nectar in her belly button that looking at which even Lord Krishn, the crest jewel of divine beauty is drinking such nectarine bliss unceasingly, giving no care to his steadfast principles of Scriptures in front of this divine bliss.","description":"https://www.brajrasik.org/hi/articles/5af7ed789f7ab760360f9c51/nagarta-ki-raasi-kishori-pada-from-hita-chaturasi-by-murali-avtaar-shri-hita-harivansh-mahaprabhu","author":"श्री हित हरिवंश महाप्रभु, श्री हित चतुरासी (82)","status":"published","content_text":"$8","tags":"$9","image_urls":"$a","video_urls":"$b","media_links":"$c","source_url":"https://www.brajrasik.org/hi/articles/5af7ed789f7ab760360f9c51/nagarta-ki-raasi-kishori-pada-from-hita-chaturasi-by-murali-avtaar-shri-hita-harivansh-mahaprabhu","slug":"nagarata-ki-rasi-kisori"}
